@page "/builds"
<PageTitle>Builds | Convergence Corp!</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Builds for Convergences in Guild Wars 2!">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://convergencecorp.net/builds" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Builds | Convergence Corp!" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://convergencecorp.net/builds"/>
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://convergencecorp.net/favicon/android-chrome-512x512.png"/>
    <meta property="og:description" content="Builds for Convergences in Guild Wars 2!"/>
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Convergence Corp!"/>
</HeadContent>
<article class="Builds-Article text-center">
    <section>
        <h1>Builds!</h1>
        <p>
            Any endgame content in GW2 can be better with a good build! Convergences are no different.
            I'm not going to create a bunch of builds for you, as there are already plenty of websites for them.
        </p>

        <h2>Build Sites</h2>
        <p>Here are some GW2 build websites in alphabetical order:</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center text-center flex-wrap gap-5">
            <!-- Accessibility Wars -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Accessibility Wars</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://aw2.help" target="_blank">
                            https://aw2.help <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text">Accessible Builds for the Guild Wars 2 Community</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Discretize -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Discretize</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://archive.discretize.eu/builds" target="_blank">
                            https://archive.discretize.eu/builds <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text alert info">Note: discretize.eu is now retired, information may be outdated.</p>
                    <p class="card-text">International high-end fractal guild.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Guild Jen -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">GuildJen</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://guildjen.com/gw2-builds" target="_blank">
                            https://guildjen.com <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text">GW2 Builds for PvE, PvP, WvW, Raid, Fractal, Strike Missions, Open World, Solo, Group, Events, Story, etc.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Hard Stuck -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Hardstuck</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://hardstuck.gg" target="_blank">
                            https://hardstuck.gg <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text">High-end and LI builds for all game modes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- MetaBattle -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">MetaBattle</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://metabattle.com/wiki/MetaBattle_Wiki" target="_blank">
                            https://metabattle.com <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text">A wide variety of builds for all game modes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- SnowCrows -->
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">SnowCrows</h2>
                    <button type="button" class="w-fit btn">
                        <a href="https://snowcrows.com" target="_blank">
                            https://snowcrows.com <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </button>
                    <p class="card-text">Optimized Raid, Beginner, LI and Open World Builds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Adjustments for Convergences:</h2>
        <div class="alert info mb-5">Note: Most of the items below only benefit Power builds. Therefore, it is recommended to bring a power build to convergences.</div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Item</th>
                <th>Inner Nayos</th>
                <th>Mount Balrior</th>
                <th>Nexus of Eternity</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Powerful Potion of Demon Slaying</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>-</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Superior Sigil of Demon Slaying</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>-</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Relic of the Eagle</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>x</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Superior Sigil of Night</td>
                <td>x</td>
                <td>-</td>
                <td>x</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    

        <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center text-center flex-wrap gap-5">
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/7A9EA9E0C702F8BA595973FED3A853646B2E07F8/222720.png" alt="potion of demon slaying" style="width:50px;"/>
                    <h4 class="card-title">Powerful Potion of Demon Slaying</h4>
                    <p class="card-text">10% Damage vs. Demons, Kryptis, and Titanspawn.</p>
                    <p class="card-text">-10% Damage from Demons, Kryptis, and Titanspawn.</p>
                    <button type="button" class="btn w-fit">
                        <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Powerful_Potion_of_Demon_Slaying" target="_blank">wiki <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/991BD2CC63CFE343C5E55D49F657C95E71FD0439/340600.png" style="width:50px;"/>
                    <h4 class="card-title">Superior Sigil of Demon Slaying</h4>
                    <p class="card-text">3% Strike Damage, +7% Strike Damage vs. Demons, Kryptis, and Titanspawn.</p>
                    <button type="button" class="btn w-fit">
                        <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Superior_Sigil_of_Demon_Slaying" target="_blank">wiki <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/DFF4EB43AD0803F60D105658052321A0BE1AF02C/3592832.png" style="width:50px;"/>
                    <h4 class="card-title">Relic of the Eagle</h4>
                    <p class="card-text">10% damage when enemy under 50% hp.</p>
                    <p>Swap to Eagle when transitioning to the third boss phase (start of 50%).</p>
                    <button type="button" class="btn w-fit">
                        <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Relic_of_the_Eagle" target="_blank">wiki <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card builds-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://render.guildwars2.com/file/CFDC642093029E790C03381D73C703BDFFA9CDFF/499391.png" style="width:50px;"/>
                    <h4 class="card-title">Superior Sigil of Night</h4>
                    <p class="card-text">3% Strike Damage, +7% Strike Damage at night.</p>
                    <button class="btn w-fit">
                        <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Superior_Sigil_of_the_Night">wiki <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
                    </button>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>
            Consider taking a <a href="https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Sigil#Stacking_bonus" target="_blank">stacking sigil <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a> to convergences. They're easy to build up during the phases before the boss spawns.
        </p>
    </section>
</article>